<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 19 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 4075, tin down 120, lead down 325, zinc down 5175, aluminium down 425, nickel up 180, aluminium alloy down 120</p>
